# Waybar Amethyst -- the palette the rest of this desktop uses.
#
# Matches konsole (Amethyst.colorscheme: Background 47,25,61 / Foreground
# 247,188,188) and pavucontrol (~/.config/gtk-3.0/palette-overrides.css),
# so Qt apps, GTK apps and the terminal all agree.
#
#   47,25,61     #2f193d  window surface        (waybar bar backdrop)
#   247,188,188  #f7bcbc  text, selection       (waybar pill)
#   110,58,131   #6e3a83  tooltips              (waybar text colour)
#   110,92,135   #6e5c87  header/titlebar strip
#   250,226,170  #fae2aa  header text, dim text, links
#
# Derived dark ramp: 34,18,44 view / 41,22,54 alternate / 68,48,80 button /
# 84,66,96 insensitive. The view sits BELOW the window, as in a dark theme.
#
# Remapped role-by-role from BreezeDark so every one of its 104 assignments
# is covered -- generation asserts it, rather than leaving gaps to inherit.
# Semantic colours keep BreezeDark's bright values: on this surface the
# darkened variants a light theme needs would vanish.

